Root cause:
The bug is caused by the failure to clear the global state between individual reuseport test runs, leading to false positives when a single test fails. Residual data in the `expected_results` array and the `result_map` can incorrectly influence the outcome of subsequent tests, as they may still contain values from previous runs.

